    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ARAVIND KUMAR FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      228.65,
      401.88,
      291.95
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS An Association called and known as the\u201cAravind Kumar Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formedin Sri Lanka, for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      306.65,
      401.9,
      369.95
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      384.65,
      401.89,
      408.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      423.53,
      401.87,
      447.95
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Aravind KumarFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      462.53,
      401.93,
      590.87
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cAravind Kumar Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation \u201c) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted shall be a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of \u201cAravind KumarFoundation\u201d and by that name may sue and be sued in allcourts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      605.57,
      401.87,
      629.87
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      644.57,
      401.9,
      668.87
    ],
    "text": "(a)to participate in social, cultural and economicdevelopment of the country;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
