  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.09,
      401.9,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of the Corporation shall consist of themembers of the Board of Administration of the Foundationholding office on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.95,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever as are necessary or desirable for the promotionor furtherance of the objects of the Corporation or any oneof them, including to open, operate and close bank accounts,to borrow or raise moneys with or without security, and toengage, employ and dismiss officers and servants requiredfor the carrying out of the objects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      387.65,
      401.9,
      460.43
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime, at any General Meeting of the members and by amajority of not less than two-thirds of the members presentand voting, to make rules, not inconsistent with theprovisions of this Act or any other written law, for all or anyof the following matters:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      473.69,
      401.86,
      509.63
    ],
    "text": "(a)classification of membership, admission,withdrawal, expulsion or resignation of membersand membership fees payable;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      522.89,
      401.87,
      583.43
    ],
    "text": "(b) procedure to be observed for the summoning andholding of meetings of the Corporation and of theBoard of Directors, the quorum for such meetingsand the exercise and performance of their powersand duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      596.69,
      401.89,
      632.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)the appointments, powers, duties and functions ofthe various officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      645.89,
      401.88,
