  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      394.49,
      401.88,
      429.83
    ],
    "text": "(3)The accounts of the Corporation shall be examinedand audited at least once in every year by an auditor orauditors appointed by the Board of Directors.",
